      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kombeddi wun jo Icrael wuwiny cik ki kop ma giŋolo ma atye ka pwonyowu kwede, wucobgi, wek wubed makwo, wucit wuo i lobo ma Rwot Lubaŋa pa kwarowu tye ka miyowu, wucam obed mewu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.18+REV.22.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yabo 22.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wumed lok mo i kom cik ma acikowu kwede-ni, pe wukwany lok mo woko ki i kome, wek wugwok cik pa Rwot Lubaŋawu ma acikowu kwede ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 25.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yam wuŋeno ki wanwu gin ma Rwot otimo i Baalpeor; pien yam Rwot Lubaŋawu okwanyo i kinwu jo ducu ma gulubo jok Baal me Peor, onekogi woko; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento wun jo ma yam wumoko i kom Rwot Lubaŋawu matek-ki pud wutye makwo ducu wa tin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenu, doŋ atyeko pwonyowu ki cik mapatpat ki gin ma Rwot oŋolo, macalo Rwot Lubaŋana ocika kwede, wek wulubgi i lobo ma wucok donyo iye me camone-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wugwokgi, wucobgi, pien meno aye bibedo ryekowu ki ŋeyo pinywu i nyim rok mukene, Gin ka giwinyo lwak cik man ducu gibiwacci, ‘Adada, rok man madit-ti tye ki ryeko, dok gin lwak ma giŋeyo piny.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien pe tye rok mukene madit ma lubaŋagi bedo cok kwedgi macalo Rwot Lubaŋawa bedo cok kwedwa i kare ducu ma wakok bote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok tye rok madit mo ma tye ki lwak cik ki kop ma giŋolo atir ma rom ki cik man ma tin aketo i nyimwuni ce?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ento myero wunen maber ni wugwokke kenwu ki cwinywu ducu, wiwu pe owil i kom gin ma wuneno ki waŋwu, wek pire pe oa woko ki i cwinywu i kare me kwowu ducu. Wutit bot litinowu ki likwayowu wek guŋe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kit ma yam wucuŋ kwede i nyim Rwot Lubaŋawu i Koreb, ci i nino meno Rwot owacca ni, ‘Cok lwak kacel bota, wek ami guwiny lokka, gupwony lworo an pi kare ducu ma gibedo kwede i wi lobo-ni, dok gin bene gupwony ki litinogi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.16+EXO.19.17+EXO.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 19.16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18+HEB.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibru 12.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci yam wubino cok, wucuŋ i te got ma onoŋo got tye ka waŋ ki mac ma oo wa i polo, i dye colpiny ki pol ma ocido licuc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Rwot yam oloko kwedwu ki i dye mac. Yam wuwinyo dwan ŋat ma loko, ento pe wuneno kom gin mo; wuwinyo dwan keken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 31.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 9.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En yam otitowu pi gicikkene ma en ocikowu ni wucobi, en aye cik apar ma en ocoyogi i kidi aryo ma apada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 21.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno Rwot ocika ni apwonywu ki cik ducu ki gin ma en oŋolo ducu, wek wulubgi i lobo ma wubicito loka ca ka camoneni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
